
@TodoApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000


### Verify DTO using GET
GET http://localhost:5000/api/todoitems/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Finish assignment",
  "isComplete": false,
  "secret": "My private information"
}

### Get all tasks
GET http://localhost:5000/api/todoitems

### Get task with ID 2
GET http://localhost:5000/api/todoitems/2

### Update task with ID 2
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/todoitems/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 2,
  "name": "feed fish",
  "isComplete": false
}

### Delete task with ID 2
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/todoitems/3
